+// Patch 0028 (VP26_VALID_REGION): vglSetNextSceneValidRegion(xMax, yMax) (pixels of the target, inclusive) arms the next scene begun on the
+// framebuffer object bound for drawing now to be begun with the SceGxmValidRegion (0, 0) - (xMax, yMax) (rounded out to whole 32-pixel
