+// GXV_HOIST_GRID pass). If sceGxmBeginScene refuses the region, the scene is begun at once again without one (the whole target: what it
+// was before), the refusal is counted and logged once, and no region is ever asked again. One begin only; a begin on another target drops
+// it. Counters: vglGetValidRegionScenes(), vglGetValidRegionRefusals().
